[gd_resource type="Theme" load_steps=14 format=3]

[ext_resource type="FontFile" path="res://assets/fonts/m5x7.ttf" id="1_font"]

; Shared UI chrome (design doc Section 16): chunky pixel-bordered panels and
; buttons, sharp corners, a warm tan/parchment base pulled from the Shelling
; Room palette, with the Pour Room's glow and Furnace Room's ember used as the
; hover/pressed accent states so buttons feel like they're "heating up" when
; touched. Applied project-wide via project.godot's gui/theme/custom rather
; than per-scene, so the pixel font and palette stay consistent everywhere,
; not just in the three menu popups.

